<title>UK: Analysts' consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>Analysts' consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending July 19 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, July 17</p>
<p>Somerfield Plc	   F   PFT	103.2	101.9-105.0  91.8</p>
<p>				   DIV	 10.2	 10.0-10.3    N/A</p>
<p>				   EPS	 26.9	 25.2-28.5   23.4</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 103.0 DIV 10.2 EPS 27.6)</p>
<p>Stanley Leisure	  F   PFT	 19.2	18.0-20.0    14.8</p>
<p>				   DIV	  3.6	 3.5-4.0	3.3</p>
<p>				   EPS	 11.8	11.2-12.2    11.8</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 19.1 DIV 3.8 EPS 11.9)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>			     ----oOo----</p>
<p>Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
